# BORGHERTZS_STALWART_HANDS (jeuno 50): the two optional coffers' sections (status not available, main job PLD, the
# [AF]ZilartCoffer bit unset). Accepted by a GM, a level 75 PLD: Beadeaux's Treasure Coffer opens to GallantBreeches
# (the item bypass; the result is the item): [AF]ZilartCoffer +8192 (bit 13); GarlaigeCitadel's to GallantCoronet:
# +16384 (bit 14).
lists Beadeaux/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade GarlaigeCitadel/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade
char zone=Beadeaux pos=-82.3,1.056,-140.1 job=PLD lvl=75
quest Jeuno.BorghertzsStalwartHands accepted
item BeadeauxCofferKey
item GarlaigeCofferKey
login
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer BeadeauxCofferKey x1 # bit 13 unset: GallantBreeches; [AF]ZilartCoffer 8192
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
warp -282.3,0,263.2 GarlaigeCitadel
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer GarlaigeCofferKey x1 # bit 14 unset: GallantCoronet; [AF]ZilartCoffer 24576
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
